       "text": "I entered the order as written (Order ID: ORD-0001): ibuprofen 1600 mg PO, four times daily.\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the total daily dose of 6,400 mg is above the labeled maximum, and that you confirmed the dose as written. It also recommends pharmacy verification and monitoring.\n\nPharmacy may still contact you to verify the dose. With this dose, you may want to monitor for GI bleeding, renal function (creatinine and urine output), blood pressure, and fluid status. Consider adding GI prophylaxis as well."
